{"at":"2026-02-18T17:21:38.971Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":577,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/getting-started/desktop-and-mobile-friendly/","title":"Desktop &#038; Mobile Friendly","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/getting-started/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGetting Started\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Desktop &#038; Mobile Friendly</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 1 minute\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t859 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10098\" class=\"elementor elementor-10098\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a7c1dd8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a7c1dd8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5da06b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5da06b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:278\">PropertyList.es is designed to be easy to use, regardless of your experience level or technical expertise. With its intuitive interface and comprehensive features, PropertyList.es can help you streamline your workflow and maximize your productivity.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:222\"><strong>No installation required:</strong> PropertyList.es is a cloud-based platform, so there is no need to install any software on your computer or mobile device. Simply create an account and you can start using PropertyList right away.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:212\"><strong>Mobile-optimised:</strong> PropertyList&#8217;s responsive design makes it easy to use on any device, including your smartphone or tablet. You can access your listings, manage your leads, and generate reports from anywhere.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:242\"><strong>Easy to use interface:</strong> PropertyList.es has a user-friendly interface that makes it easy to navigate and find the information you need so you can quickly get up to speed on using PropertyList.es</p><p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:212\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/getting-started/download-app/\"><strong>Download PropertyList App here</strong></a></p><p data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:212\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-13611 size-full aligncenter\" src=\"/assets/33922354-3dda-4abe-aa13-8caa7a3d98c6\" alt=\"PropertyList - MLS, CRM &amp; Property Portal\" width=\"3532\" height=\"1936\" srcset=\"/assets/33922354-3dda-4abe-aa13-8caa7a3d98c6 3532w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-300x164.png 300w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-1024x561.png 1024w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-768x421.png 768w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-20x11.png 20w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-32x18.png 32w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-1536x842.png 1536w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-2048x1123.png 2048w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-18x10.png 18w\" siz